<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <meta name="description" content="Choose a photographer by their pictures. Browse packages, save favorites and write about the shoot." />
    <title>Frame</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css" />
  </head>
  <body class="guest-page">
    <%- include('../partials/navbar', { page: 'other' }) %>

    <main class="welcome-page">
            <header class="welcome-hero">
        <div>
          <h1>Choose a photographer by their pictures.</h1>
          
          <p class="welcome-lead">
            Frame lists photography packages with real photos, 
            videos and prices. Save the ones you like, 
            follow the people behind them, 
            and write about the shoot afterward.
          </p>
          
          <div class="welcome-actions">
            <a class="button" href="/auth/sign-up">Create an account</a>
            <a class="button quiet" href="/auth/sign-in">Sign in</a>
          </div>
        
        </div>

        <figure class="contact-sheet">
          
          <div class="sheet-frames">
          
            <div class="sheet-frame">
              <img src="/images/desert.jpg" alt="Red rock towers rising from a desert valley" />
              <span>1</span>
            </div>
          
            <div class="sheet-frame sheet-pick">
              <img src="/images/portrait.jpg" alt="A portrait lit in blue and violet" />
              <span>2</span>
            </div>
          
            <div class="sheet-frame">
              <img src="/images/coast.jpg" alt="A low wave at dusk" />
              <span>3</span>
            </div>
          
            <div class="sheet-frame">
              <img src="/images/camera.jpg" alt="A camera and two lenses on a dark table" />
              <span>4</span>
            </div>
          
          </div>
          
          <figcaption>Circle the frames you like. On Frame, that is a favorite.</figcaption>
        
        </figure>
      
      </header>

            <section class="welcome-roles" aria-label="What you can do on Frame">
        <div>
          <h2>Booking a shoot</h2>
      
          <ul>
            <li>Browse packages with photos, videos and fixed prices.</li>
            <li>Save favorites, then add a package to your cart.</li>
            <li>Follow photographers and write a blog about a package you saved.</li>
          </ul>
      
        </div>
      
        <div>
          <h2>Offering a shoot</h2>
      
          <ul>
            <li>Publish a package with up to 10 photos or videos.</li>
            <li>Set the price and edit it whenever you need to.</li>
            <li>Build a following and read what customers write.</li>
          </ul>
      
        </div>
      
      </section>
  </body>
</html>
